img-01_hu_645a4fbdb773666b.png 300w,/blog/use-caps-lock-to-change-keyboard-layout-in-gnome-pop-os/img-01_hu_f2bbc236a20a418b.png 500w,/blog/use-caps-lock-to-change-keyboard-layout-in-gnome-pop-os/img-01_hu_1a4a5b2b8f18c5c9.png 700w&#34;&#xA;        sizes=&#34;(max-width: 499px) 300px,(max-width: 699px) 500px,700px&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;use Caps Lock to change keyboard layout in gnome / pop-os / ..&#34;&#xA;        &#xA;        loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;        width=&#34;948&#34;&#xA;        height=&#34;747&#34;&#xA;      /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
